F. graeca v. thessalica germ. 40-70D(1/1 1 on 4th d).
F. imperialis germ. 40-70-40-70(2/3 in 1-3 w) and none when started at 70.
F. lanceolata germ. 40(100\% in 6-8 w), 70-40(90\% in 6-8 w), and 25\% in March
