M. paniculata germ. 48\% in 1-3w in either 70L or 70D. A 3 m at 40 was fatal.
Melaleuca (Myrtaceae).
M. diosmafolia germ. 70D(40\% in 4 . 8 d), 70D GA-3(100\% in 2nd w), 40(50\% in
