M. huegeri germ. 3/3 in 4th w in 70D.
Melampodi um (Asteraceae). M. cinereum germ. in 2-4 w at 70.
Melampyrum (Scrophulariaceae). M. lineare germ. 70-40(55\% in 4-8 w)
and 40-70(10\%)-40(20\%)-70. In outdoor treatment seeds started germinating in
