M. nuda germ. 40(70\% in 3-12 w) and less in 70D(20\%) and 70L(5\%).
Merendera (Llliaceae) Although samples were small, germination
appears to occur only at 40 and a preliminary 3 m at 70 is beneficial.
M. pyrenaica germ. 70-40(4/8 in 4th w) and 40-70(none).
