M. lanceolata germ. 70(70\% in 4 d-4 w) and 40-70(30\% on 2nd d).
M. virginica seed germ. 70-40(1/63)-70(1/63) and rotted if DS or sown at 40
Meum (Apiaceae). M. athamanticum germ. 40(2/7 in 7th w) and 70-40(2/8 in
