R. tibeticum germ. 70(4/4 in 3-4 d) and 40(4/4 in 4th w).
Rhexla (Melastomaceae). Both of the species studied required light.
R. mariana germ. 70L(96\% in 4th w) and 40-70L(73\% in 2nd w). None germ. in
